    "updated_at": "2015-11-25T20:57:54Z",
    "body": "How is that different from all the other things that we do different when going back to a bfcached page? I.e. that we maintain the DOM state, that we don't fire 'load' events, etc? Is there a reason you are worried about the scoll state more than these other things?\n",
