    "updated_at": "2015-11-25T22:55:22Z",
    "body": "But ok, if you two think this inconsistency isn't too bad, I can live with it. But the spec should clarify that 'manual' may lead to page staying in the position it was when it navigated away. Or it may lead position being something else (0,0 in practice).\n",
